  "prefLabel": "Soil 104.02 Custodian of Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Soil 104.02 Custodian of Records. Persons desiring copies of board records shall submit a written request to OPLC as required in Plc 104 which identifies as particularly as possible the information being sought and agree to pay the actual costs incurred by the OPLC for the documents provided. If records are requested which contain both public and confidential information, the OPLC shall delete the confidential information and provide the remaining information.\n\nSource. #8006, eff 12-18-03; ss by #14535, eff 4-1-26",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/soil100-500.html"
}
